-[0.9375rem] leading-relaxed text-eng-navy-800","children":"Point of view controls what information you are allowed to have. A first-person account cannot tell you what anyone else was thinking — so when a question asks what someone else believed, the answer must be an inference from behavior, not a statement."}]]}]]}],"$L18","$L19"]}]]}],"$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20"]}]
